          <div class="showcase-lead-body">
            <span class="showcase-pill">Foundation Day Cultural Signature · Late October</span>
            <h3>Sang-at Festival & Panangatan Heritage</h3>
            <p>
              Rooted in the Cebuano verb <em>sang-at</em>—how early coastal fishermen lifted their wooden outrigger boats onto the elevated, nipa-lined banks of the Panangatan River during the monsoon. Celebrated with street dancing every October.
            </p>
            <span class="showcase-cta">Read the Sang-at cultural profile →</span>
