          Reach municipal offices at Valencia Municipal Hall in Poblacion, follow official public advisories from the Local Government Unit, or plan your overland travel along the southern Bohol coastal road.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-actions">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Contact & Directions</a>
        <a
          href="https://www.facebook.com/lguvalofficialpage"
